+## 2026-11-02
+- **Approving a posting no longer makes other approvals wait** ([#65](https://github.com/trysarathy/investigation-desk/pull/65)).
+  When Xero was slow to answer (for example while it refreshed its connection), every other approval
+  on the Books page waited behind it. Clearline now waits for Xero without holding up anyone else, and
+  records the result as soon as Xero answers. What gets posted, and the approval step, are unchanged.
+  Nothing to do.
+
